# Probe files the live Docker test (tests/test_docker.py) writes into app/ and deletes again. A run
# killed mid-test leaves them behind. Every probe name is probe_tag() output, gatherlane-probe- and
# then a digit, so a real file such as gatherlane-prober.js or gatherlane-probe-notes.js stays
# trackable.
/app/**/gatherlane-probe-[0-9]*
/app/**/.gatherlane-probe-[0-9]*
